  "all_ingredients_flat": "jowar flour (sorghum flour), brown rice flour, amchoor (raw mango powder), haldi (turmeric powder), black pepper, saunf (fennel seed powder), hing (asafoetida), ajwain (carom seeds), peanut butter, Curry Leaves Dry Chutney, warm plant based milk, warm water, Amla Dates Chutney, Mint Coriander Chutney",
  "instructions": "Mix all ingredients together to make a dough — neither too soft nor too hard.\nMade small balls with the dough. Place them on parchment paper with some distance in between. Spread another parchment paper on top and press them one by one with the bottom of a glass tumbler. Prick them with fork before baking.\nBake both sides for 10 minutes each at 180 C.",
